# Keep the Docker build context small. The cluster image (examples/cluster/Dockerfile)
# only needs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, and src/ — everything below is excluded from the
# context sent to the daemon. Without this, the ~21G models/ and ~9G target/ dirs would
# be uploaded on every `docker compose ... build`.
target/
models/
.git/
.superpowers/
docs/
script/
*.md

# examples/ is intentionally NOT ignored: it contains the Dockerfile and smoke-test.sh.
